0,Ulukwumi language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulukwumi_language,"Atlantic–Congo. Volta–Niger.Ulukwumi, also known as Olùkùmi, is a Yoruboid language spoken by the Olukumi people of Aniocha North LGA, Delta State, Nigeria.",Olùkùmi,Niger-Congo
